{"version":1,"ops":[{"type":1,"author":{"id":"819663238374c863923453c36b916c251f565216"},"timestamp":1506010624,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDU6SXNzdWUyNTk1NTM0OTQ=","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/1850","origin":"github"},"title":"install fails to initialize annex when installing into a dataset as a subdataset ","message":"This might be about direct mode only - not sure ATM.\n\nHowever, test `datalad/distribution/tests/test_install.py:test_install_into_dataset` fails in direct mode,\nsince the installed subdataset `sub` isn't considered to be an annex, therefore yields `GitRepo` and then `ok_clean_git` fails with `AttributeError: 'GitRepo' object has no attribute '_submodules_dirty_direct_mode'` (raised at annexrepo.py line 552)\n\nTurns out the submodule in question has an `annex/direct/master` branch only, which is the result of just cloning a direct mode repo without initializing annex afterwards.","files":null}]}